[00:00.000] 作词 : Angelo De Augustine
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Angelo De Augustine
[00:13.923] Who can claim to understand their place within the universe's plan?
[00:21.024] I tried my best to know
[00:25.523] Rose petals at our feet
[00:28.123] Fathers weep
[00:29.756] Mothers cry themselves to sleep
[00:32.941] For the babe in you
[00:34.623] The child in me
[00:36.716]
[00:37.941] I just want to lay here with you by my side
[00:43.875] And take you for another cosmic ride
[00:50.107] Even though the empire will dissolve into fire
[00:56.173] And the waters of the sea will rise
[01:02.116]
[01:03.775] Will I have the chance to find my way before it's all said and done?
[01:10.875] Before the race is lost and won
[01:14.649]
[01:15.523] My generation wakes another day
[01:19.452] Until the old guard fades away
[01:23.003] When time is on the run
[01:25.714]
[01:27.670] I don't want to stay here and have to say goodbye
[01:33.736] To all I've ever loved, and watch it die
[01:39.720] Love is still the answer in its infinite supply
[01:45.736] But wounds can only heal in their own time
[01:51.479]
